   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "RULES FOR ALL MEMORY\n\nWork only: personal talk is never saved\nAn answer uses only what everyone\nwho sees it may see\nFacts from a 1:1 chat never reach a channel\nDeleted in Teams or 'forget this' => removed\n(a marker stops re-learning)\nOld facts shown 'as of' after 120 days;\none-off facts deleted after 180 days\nPerson leaves: personal memory deleted\nafter 30 days; their work stays\nPeople can see + correct what Max knows",
   "originalText": "RULES FOR ALL MEMORY\n\nWork only: personal talk is never saved\nAn answer uses only what everyone\nwho sees it may see\nFacts from a 1:1 chat never reach a channel\nDeleted in Teams or 'forget this' => removed\n(a marker stops re-learning)\nOld facts shown 'as of' after 120 days;\none-off facts deleted after 180 days\nPerson leaves: personal memory deleted\nafter 30 days; their work stays\nPeople can see + correct what Max knows",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
